 Up to about 500 keV levels are fairly well resolved in capture   2631 1451  570
 but above 500 keV capture data are less well resolved than       2631 1451  571
 transmission data. Therefore capture peak areas of unresolved    2631 1451  572
 multiplets are split and distributed among the separate          2631 1451  573
 components seen in transmission. Spins and parities are taken    2631 1451  574
 from Perey and Perey 80 below 400 keV, from Cierjacks 78 above.  2631 1451  575
 Statistical analysis of the s-wave levels indicates for          2631 1451  576
 0 - 862keV                                                       2631 1451  577
   Mean level spacing   D  = 22 +- 2 KEV,                         2631 1451  578
   Strength function    S0 = (2.3 +- .7)/10000.                   2631 1451  579
